      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "It's kind of you to take this on again.\r\nWe are truly grateful, Arisen.",
        "Jp" : "此度もお引き受けくださるとは――\r\n覚者様のお心遣いに感謝いたします"
