      "MsgSerial" : 448607,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Some have heard a voice come from within\r\nthe Forsaken Well... We wonder if any of\r\nthe missing children or one of their parents\r\ncould still be alive inside.",
        "Jp" : "《見捨てられた井戸》から聞こえたという人の声――\r\nもしかすると居なくなった子供たちや\r\nその親の誰かが、井戸の中で生きているのではと\r\n希望を捨てきれないのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482252,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, there is also a good chance that it could\r\nbe something... sinister, so we are afraid to go\r\ncheck it out ourselves.",
        "Jp" : "しかし、魔物の声である可能性も高いので\r\n我々が調べに行くこともできず――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482253,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "We have no choice but to rely on you, Arisen.\r\nIf you could verify whether anyone is in the\r\ndepths of the well, it would help us find closure.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様のような方にお頼りするしかないのです\r\n井戸の奥に誰も居ないかを確認していただければ\r\n我々も諦めがつくというもの\r\nどうかよろしくお願いいたします"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482254,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
