      "MsgSerial" : 448609,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The parents entered the well in search of\r\ntheir children only to become Medusa's prey...\r\nand even those who managed to escape the well\r\nwere attacked by the clan of gargoyles...",
        "Jp" : "子供を探して井戸の中に入った親たちは\r\nそこでメドゥーサの餌食となったのですね――\r\nそして、命からがら井戸から逃げ出した者すら\r\nガーゴイルの群れに襲われた――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482256,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I never imagined such a thing could happen...!\r\nWere there any signs of children in that well?",
        "Jp" : "そのような事態が起こっているとは\r\n予想だにしませんでした――\r\nときに、あの井戸の中に子供の姿はあったでしょうか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482257,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I see... so there were no traces of the children\r\nin the well. Where in the world could they have\r\ngone...",
        "Jp" : "――そうですか、井戸に\r\n子供たちが居た形跡は無かったのですね\r\nあの子たちは一体どこに行ってしまったのか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482258,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
